You are now ready to execute any of the pre-defined tests! It is best to start with the
simplest test: applying hardware reset then reading all of the registers to verify their
reset values. Many of the problems with the DUT, the RAL model, or the integration
of the two will be identified by this simple test.
Command:
% <sim> +UVM_TESTNAME=cmdline_test \
+UVM_REG_SEQ=uvm_reg_hw_reset_test
